{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46 6期生の\n瀬戸口心月（せとぐち みつき）です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "遅くなりましたが、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2.1 のリアルミート&グリート\nありがとうございました！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ずーーっと行きたかったんです！京都✨"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobOoziqU.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "京都を感じるところは行けなかったんですけど、初上陸嬉しかったなーーー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつかメンバーと旅行行きたいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あとあと"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日は、全部髪チェン成功✨"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobvksLWs.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "褒めてくださってありがとうございました！\nわたし褒めたら伸びる子心月です^_^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きっとね、\n褒めてもらえるのって、見てくれてる証拠だから。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちゃんと気づいてくれて、\nちゃんと伝えてくれて、\nその優しさが嬉しいんです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "だからまた調子に乗って、\nいろんな髪型しちゃうかもしれないけど"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そのたびに一緒に楽しんでくれたらうれしいなー。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も見つけてくれて、\nありがとうございます🌙❤️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しかったこと⬇️"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/moble3Kel.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "写真撮ってもらっていたら、\n吉田さんが入ってきてくださって😆💕"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ほーんとに嬉しかったです！！！！！\n（とってもニコニコしているね笑）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobGTzvQ5.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobmehpdX.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "可愛くて綺麗な祝花、ありがとうございます！\nぜーんぶ目にも心にも、写真にも焼き付けてます👀✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "幸せな時間をありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "次は幕張メッセ！\nまた会いましょう😌❤️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しみだなっ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日は、軽めのブログ！\nまた書きますね、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1日お疲れさまです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "心月（みつき）"}], "source": "official"}